---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import LegalBody from '../components/LegalBody.astro';
import { site } from '../site.js';
---

<Layout title="Terms of use" description="The terms for using ConVo Neighborhood's website and services.">
  <PageHeader label="Legal" title="Terms of use" lede="Last updated November 2026." />
  <LegalBody>
    <h2>1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
    <p>
      By accessing or using ConVo Neighborhood (“CVN,” “we,” “our,” or “us”), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use.
      If you do not agree, please do not use our platform, services, or ecosystem.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Services overview</h2>
    <p>ConVo Neighborhood is a branding and consulting firm providing digital services, including but not limited to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Brand development and strategy</li>
      <li>Business consulting</li>
      <li>Digital ecosystem integration</li>
      <li>Access to third-party platforms and tools</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any service at any time.</p>

    <h2>3. User responsibilities</h2>
    <p>You agree to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide accurate and complete information</li>
      <li>Use our services lawfully and ethically</li>
      <li>Respect intellectual property and platform integrity</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You may not:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Misuse, copy, or exploit our systems or content without permission</li>
      <li>Attempt unauthorized access to any part of the ecosystem</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Payments and refunds</h2>
    <p>
      All payments for services are non-refundable unless otherwise stated in writing. Service delivery timelines and
      follow-ups are based on the scope of each individual service agreement.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Third-party integrations</h2>
    <p>Our ecosystem may integrate with third-party platforms, tools, or services. We are not responsible for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Third-party content, policies, or practices</li>
      <li>Downtime, errors, or data handling by external platforms</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Users are encouraged to review each third party’s terms and policies.</p>

    <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      All content, branding systems, frameworks, and materials created by CVN remain the intellectual property of ConVo
      Neighborhood unless otherwise agreed in writing.
    </p>
    <p>Clients are granted usage rights only as defined within their service agreement.</p>

    <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>ConVo Neighborhood is not liable for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Business outcomes, losses, or damages resulting from service use</li>
      <li>Indirect or incidental damages</li>
      <li>Platform interruptions or ecosystem changes</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>8. Termination</h2>
    <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate access to our services at our discretion if terms are violated.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions regarding these Terms, contact the ConVo Neighborhood Support Team at
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </LegalBody>
</Layout>
